    ecologicalRole: "A small terrestrial herbivore in the forest-floor food web.",
    pressures: "Loss and fragmentation of mature forest reduce suitable cover and feeding habitat.",
    watch: "Remain on trails and let it disappear into cover. Do not pursue it for a closer photograph.",
