    ecologicalRole: "Helps spread seeds from fruit and can visit flowers for nectar.",
    pressures: "Loss of roosts and fruiting vegetation can remove shelter and food.",
    watch: "Do not handle a bat or disturb a roost. Observe from a distance and seek professional help for an injured animal.",
